      "why_ablation_validity_does_not_depend_on_them": "ALL FIVE CELLS SHARE THEM. The 2x2+placebo contrast is matched on everything except quantizer x arm, so a step budget or learning rate that is too small weakens every arm identically and cannot manufacture or destroy the paired difference DIR(4-5). Only REPRODUCIBILITY depends on these, which is why they are recorded here rather than pinned."
    },
